# ==============================================================================
# Portfolio Environment Variables Configuration
# ==============================================================================

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Email Delivery Service (100% Free)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Resend provides 3,000 emails/month (100 emails/day) completely free forever.
# 1. Sign up at: https://resend.com
# 2. Generate an API Key under API Keys tab
# 3. Paste your key below:
RESEND_API_KEY=re_your_free_resend_api_key_here

# The recipient address that receives contact form messages (Kept strictly on backend):
CONTACT_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=tusharbasak97@gmail.com

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Cloudflare Turnstile Bot Defense (100% Free)
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Cloudflare Turnstile provides unlimited free challenges with zero user friction.
# 1. Sign in to Cloudflare Dashboard: https://dash.cloudflare.com/?to=/:account/turnstile
# 2. Click "Add site" -> Enter your domain (e.g. tusharbasak.vercel.app or localhost)
# 3. Copy the Site Key and Secret Key below:
#
# (Leave blank in local development if you want to test without Turnstile)
NEXT_PUBLIC_CLOUDFLARE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY=
CLOUDFLARE_TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY=
